Type: Package
Package: clustermole
Title: Cell Type Marker Database for Single-Cell RNA-Seq Data
Version: 1.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Igor", "Dolgalev", , "igor.dolgalev@nyumc.org", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4451-126X"))
Description: Provides a meta-database of thousands of human and mouse cell
    identity markers curated from multiple sources, along with methods for
    cell type prediction based on marker gene overlaps or gene set
    enrichment.
